cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies.
title: >-
  ercp-cbds-lnn: a liquid neural network for predicting common bile duct stone
  recurrence after ERCP
abstract: >-
  Trained liquid time-constant (LTC) neural network, fitted preprocessing pipelines, clinical data
  dictionary and inference code for predicting common bile duct stone recurrence after endoscopic
  retrograde cholangiopancreatography from six routinely available predictors.
type: software
license: MIT
